==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{af|ru|породи́ть|-а́ть}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|порожда́ть}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-порождать.ogg}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|порожда́ть|impf|pf=породи́ть}}

# to [[beget]], to [[cause]], to [[entail]], to [[generate]]
# to [[engender]], to [[give rise]]
# ''(obsolete)'' to [[give birth]]

====Usage notes====
In modern speech, this verb is only used figuratively in reference to abstract ideas or concepts. (E.g. Насилие порождает насилие.) For physical, biological birth, see [[рожать]]. 

====Conjugation====
{{ru-conj|impf|1a|порожда́ть}}

